INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,4,3,0,null,2,'<p>This document is prepared and maintained by Lockheed Martin Space Systems Central Estimating.</p> <p>For any suggestions or improvements to this document or help finding LMSSC Proposal support please <span style="color: black;">contact Bob McKenry at 303-932-4405 </span>or email: <a href="mailto:robert.b.mckenry@lmco.com">robert.b.mckenry@lmco.com</a></p>',0,0,4);
