INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,23,13,3,'FBM Field Processing Overhead',1,'',0,0,23);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,24,23,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">The FBM Field Processing pool includes the indirect costs of cost centers located at the FBM Field sites. Indirect Labor and Non-labor Costs include: Depreciation, Restructure, Union Business, Allocations from Services Total Expense Pool, IT costs of Enterprise Company-owned desktops, laptops, printers and servers.</p>',0,0,24);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,25,23,1,null,3,'',0,0,25);
