INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,64,63,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Major functions, activities, and elements of non-labor cost include: Allocations from SSC Core Segment Common Procurement Overhead and Services Total</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Base: SSC Services Segment Onsite and Offsite Services Pool direct material, direct subcontract and consultant costs. Excludes IWTA and Job Shoppers.</p>',0,0,64);
