INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,76,75,0,'FCCOM',1,'',0,0,76);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,77,76,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">FCCOM will be included as an element of the cost/price offer for all cost-reimbursement contracts with the United States Government, except in the situation of modifications to existing contracts where FAR Clause 52.215-17 &ndash; &ldquo;Waiver of Facilities Capital Cost of Money&rdquo; has already been incorporated.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><u><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="text-decoration: none;">&nbsp;</span></span></u></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">The 2017-2019 &amp; On CAS 414 rates, reference letters FPRA 16-04 dated July 8, 2016</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The 2016 actual overhead rates, reference LMSSC-17-003 memo dated January 11, 2017</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">The 2015 actual CAS 414 rates, reference letter LMSSC-16-001 memo dated January 8, 2016</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">The 2014 actual CAS 414 rates, reference letter LMSSC-15-001 memo dated January 9, 2015</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><u><span style="color: red; font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="text-decoration: none;">&nbsp;</span></span></u></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="color: black; font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">FCCOM rates are applied to dollars associated with each pool (reference Overhead base).</span></p> <p style="tab-stops: 17.2pt 197.05pt 208.85pt 258.6pt 308.35pt 358.1pt 407.85pt 469.15pt;">The asset distribution and Treasury rate is provided to complete 1861 forms and weighted guidelines.</p><p>(NOTE: ProPricer rounds Treasury rates to 3-decimal points)</p>',0,0,77);
