INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,107,106,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none;">Current labor, travel and material costs are representative mid-year costs.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: black;">Heritage Labor Escalation</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <table style="margin: auto auto auto 4.65pt; width: 313.4pt; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody> <tr style="height: 18.9pt;"> <td style="background: #002060; padding: 0in 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid black; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2016</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2017</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2018</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2019</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 67.8pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2020</span></strong></p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 18.9pt;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 67.8pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">FPRA 16-07, dated July 18, 2016</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">Labor escalation rates for the following activity types include union agreement terms for union-represented hourly employees (Level A) and will differ from the table above: XXDD, XXDP, XXLM, XXKP, XXRR, XXAD, XXSD, XXSP, MMSD, MMSP, FBSD, FBSP, FBWF, FBEF, FBGF, XXZD, XXZP</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: black;">Mission Solutions Escalation</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <table style="margin: auto auto auto 4.65pt; width: 245.6pt; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody> <tr style="height: 18.9pt;"> <td style="background: #002060; padding: 0in 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid black; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2016</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2017</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2018</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2019</span></strong></p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 18.9pt;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">2.5%</p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">(FPRA 16-06 Rev 1, dated September 19, 2016)</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: black;">Salaried Labor Rate Escalation for years beyond Agreement (Non-represented Labor Level A through Labor Level E)</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">Lockheed Martin Space Systems (LMSSC) consults a variety of sources (both internal to LM and external) when forecasting labor rate escalation. As uncertainty and risk increase in the out years, escalation trends tend to increase. Based on economic forecast data and industry trends, LMSSC forecast a Heritage labor escalation of 3% for years 2021 &amp; On and 3% escalation for years 2020 &amp; beyond for Mission Solutions. This escalation is not a submitted or negotiated rate.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="background: yellow; color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: black;">Union Represented Labor Rate Escalation for years 2021</span></strong> <strong><span style="color: black;">&amp; On (Level A - Heritage)</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">Escalation for Level A union represented employees are based on Collective Bargaining Agreements (CBAs). Current union contract conditions used for calculating the escalation percentage are replicated for future years.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none;">Current labor, travel and material costs are representative mid-year costs.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: black;">Heritage Labor Escalation</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <table style="margin: auto auto auto 4.65pt; width: 313.4pt; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody> <tr style="height: 18.9pt;"> <td style="background: #002060; padding: 0in 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid black; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2016</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 61.4pt; height: 18.9pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2017</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #002060; border-widt