INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,124,106,6,'Other Travel Costs',1,'',0,0,124);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,125,124,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><u>DOMESTIC TRAVEL</u></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Total travel costs will be escalated with the composite escalation rates with the exception of the car rental. Car rental rate agreement is currently through 2019 and should not be escalated until 2020. The escalation rates have been adjusted.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">Concur, a Lockheed Martin travel service provides current airfare costs.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">Rates are based on current quotes and include any Lockheed Martin discounts.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">The per diem rates used in this proposal are those published in the Joint Federal Travel Regulations, General Services Administration (GSA) for Fiscal Year <span style="color: black;">2017.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">Auto rental rates are from the current agreement between Lockheed Martin and Avis (effective 2/1/2017 - 10/14/2019) Use Concur to confirm rates.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <table style="width: 408pt; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="padding: 0in 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid black; width: 115pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong>Daily Base Rate</strong></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong>Daily rate A</strong></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong>Daily rate B</strong></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong>Daily Rate C</strong></p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 115pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: black;">$31.95</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong>$30.95</strong></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong>$31.95</strong></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong>$37.20</strong></p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 115pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;" rowspan="2"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;">All others not listed in A, B or C</span></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">BOSTON</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">NEWARK APO</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">NY CITY</p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">CHICAGO</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">LGA</p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 115pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">DETROIT</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">JFK</p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 115pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">ALASKA</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 115pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">PUERTO RICO</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 0.2in;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 black black; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 115pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 113pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">NEW YORK METRO</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 94pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 black black #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 0.2in; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;"><span style="color: black;">Personal Car is priced using the current Federal standard mileage rate of $0.535/mile for 2017</span><span style="color: black;">.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">Concur Travel charges a Transaction Fee for each trip booked based on method of booking. Based on 2016 SSC travel actuals the average for 2016 is $16. ($42 full service by phone, $12 online, $8.00 car only). This fee is added to each trip per person. (In PROPRICER travel reporting, this cost shows up as Miscellaneous Costs)</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">Other Travel Costs (OTC) are based on Jan &ndash;Dec 2015 Lockheed Martin Space Systems history. This rate includes: airport fees, airport shuttle, baggage fees, parking, telephone, tolls, rental car fuel, and personal car. ($14/day) (In PROPRICER this cost is added to the daily per diem rate.)</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">Taxes are added to the lodging costs and rental car costs. The tax rate is from GSA.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><u>INTERNATIONAL TRAVEL</u></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p>For international travel rates &ndash; contact Concur Travel<span style="color: black;">. For US Government proposals, coach air-fare will be used for pricing purposes. Employees will be reimbursed for coach or business or first class per policy. The expense system will automatically allocate the airfare to allowable (coach) and unallowable (costs greater than coach).</span></p>',0,0,125);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,126,null,4,'Service Centers - Direct Allocations to Contracts',1,'',0,0,126);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,127,126,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Service centers are departments or other functional units which perform specific technical and/or administrative services primarily for the benefit of other units.&nbsp;&nbsp; Generally, costs incurred by the Service Centers are allocated to specific final cost objectives as direct costs. The allocation base is all hours within a Line of Business, program or specific Cost Centers. The base hours for all service centers include LMSSC and Job-shopper hours.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">IRAD, B&amp;P &amp; CIP will be included in the base for the allocation of Advanced Technology Center MSC (541750/541755), California Earthquake (541110) and service centers but no other MSC or functional service center allocations.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">The Mission Solutions Management Service Center (541940) is only applied to Mission Solutions activity type labor hours. <span style="color: black;">When Mission Solutions labor is proposed in another SSC LOB prime proposal, the prime SSC LOB Management Service Center (MSC) and the Mission Solutions LOB MSC will both be applied to the Mission Solutions labor.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">The Service Center rates are prepared and negotiated by the Resource Management &amp; Rates organization. Monthly reports on actual trends are submitted to the DACO.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Rates are displayed through 2019 for Functional Service Centers and Line-of-Business Service Centers. Rates beyond these years are escalated using labor and non-labor escalation rates shown in Section 4.3.<a name="_Toc155685419"></a><a name="_Toc155685012"></a><a name="_Toc116962008"></a><a name="_Toc116961947"></a><a name="_Toc116961886"></a></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Letter Embedded:</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; page-break-after: avoid;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; page-break-after: avoid;">&nbsp;</p>',0,0,127);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,128,126,1,'538003 - Civil Space Planetary Exploration Systems MSC ',1,'',0,0,128);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,129,128,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Denver labor, Travel, and ODC dollars incurred by Civil Space Planetary Exploration Systems line of business Executives, Managers, and Administrative support personnel and their assignees performing functions such as common product area oversight and reviews, personnel coordination, and general management tasks. Includes IT costs related to engineering workstations, dedicated servers and non-standard software and travel costs.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">Base = Total labor hours regardless of location charged to Denver portion of the Civil Space Planetary Exploration Systems line of business </span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">Result = Labor cost in Development Pool</span> <span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">and ODC dollars</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p> <table style="margin: auto auto auto 5.9pt; width: 267pt; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody> <tr style="height: 16.5pt;"> <td style="background: #1f497d; border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 71pt; height: 16.5pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: white;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #1f497d; padding: 0in 5.4pt; border: #000000; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2016</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #1f497d; border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2017</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #1f497d; padding: 0in 5.4pt; border: #000000; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2018</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #1f497d; border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: white;">2019</span></strong></p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 16.5pt;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 71pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Labor</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$1.34</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$1.88</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$1.04</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$1.08</p> </td> </tr> <tr style="height: 16.5pt;"> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 71pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Non Labor</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$1.79</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$2.62</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$1.45</p> </td> <td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt 0px; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext #000000; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 49pt; height: 16.5pt; background-color: transparent;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: center;">$1.49</p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p 