INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,141,140,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in;">SSC labor and non-labor cost incurred to supervise and support operation of Test Labs. Effort includes labs supervision (manpower planning, salary management and staffing), business operation (management and clerical support, budget tracking, procurement support and property management, Certified Test Conductor and technical training programs), and operations and facilities management. Non-labor cost includes expendable and consumable operating supplies applicable to multiple programs and effective 1/1/08 depreciation for fixed asset tooling and equipment used in Test Labs.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in 0in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">Base = Direct labor hours charged to contracts by personnel assigned to Test Labs Sending Cost Centers in the Development Overhead Pool (Core Segment)</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">Result = Labor cost in Development Pool</span> <span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">and ODC dollars</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; tab-stops: -.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <table style="margin: auto auto auto 5.9pt; width: 286pt; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody> <tr style="height: 16.5pt;"> <td style="background: #1f497d; border-width: 0px 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: #000000 windowtext windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 86pt; height: 16.5pt;"> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="color: white;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> </td> <td style="background: #1f497d; border-w