INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,152,126,7,'541183 - Metrology',1,'',0,0,152);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),1,153,152,0,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Metrology services and related Engineering Support services performed by SSC Services Segment for the calibration of Measuring and Test Equipment (M&amp;TE). Also includes costs of outside vendor repairs/calibration and SSC labor for financial administration of the metrology process.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-family: ''Times New Roman'',serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Base: Metrology costs are assigned on a YTD basis to the requesting contract, LMSSC Functional Organization, LMC Business area or commercial entity based on the current month calibration hours and metrology engineering support hours reported by the LMMS Metrology Network system. Dollars are assigned based on the percentage of calibration and engineering support hours charged to each cost objective.</p>',0,0,153);
