em Status.</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;">Disclosure Statement Status</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">Lockheed Martin Space Systems Company Home Office&nbsp;(no changes in 2017)</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">Revision #1 dated February 1, 2016, Effective January 01, 2016</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">Lockheed Martin Space Systems Company Core Segment &nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">Revision #17 dated January 1, 2017, Effective January 01, 2017</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">Lockheed Martin Space Systems Company Services Segment &nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">Revision #2017 dated January 1, 2017, Effective January 01, 2017</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in;">Latest Adequacy (Rev. #15) September 29, 2015</p> <p style="margin: 6pt 0in 0pt; tab-stops: 0in center .5in left 1.0in 1.5in;"><strong><span style="color: black;">Note: To verify current status, please contact Central Estimating.</span></strong></p>',0,0,277);
