INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),2,396,393,2,null,2,'<p style="margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;">FPRA 16-07, dated July 18, 2016<br /> <br />Labor escalation rates for the following activity types include union agreement terms for union-represented hourly employees (Level A) and will differ from the table above: XXDD, XXDP, XXLM, XXKP, XXRR, XXAD, XXSD, XXSP, MMSD, MMSP, FBSD, FBSP, FBWF, FBEF, FBGF, XXZD, XXZP</p>			',0,0,116);
