INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),2,418,417,0,null,2,'<p>SSC, Sunnyvale costs to insure assets in California against risk of loss due to earthquakes.</p> <p>Base = Direct labor hours charged to contracts by employees in pre-assigned cost centers in California (excludes Services Segment).<br />Result = ODC dollars</p>			',0,0,138);
