INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),2,444,443,0,null,2,'<p>Reproduction labor and consumable materials and supplied expended in the production of various types of hardcopy and softcopy media.</p> <p>Dollars are allocated to direct WBS accounts and overhead cost centers on a year-to-date average expense rate basis for volume and type of service requested.</p> <p>This ODC cost must be estimated based on your actual contract allocation - Proposed as a factor. Rates are not published by program.</p>			',0,0,164);
