INSERT INTO [dbo].[Section] ([UpdateDate],[RevisionID],[ID],[ParentID],[DisplayOrder],[Title],[SectionContentTypeID],[TextContent],[IsInternalSection],[DisplayRateCode],[RevisionUniqueSectionId]) VALUES (GETDATE(),2,564,563,0,null,2,'<p style="tab-stops: -.5in 0in;">This form <u>will be included</u> in all proposals that require cost or pricing data (this excludes competitive and commercial proposals).&nbsp; It is intended to be filled out by customers and forwarded to DCMA for inclusion into a metric measurement on LMSSC Estimating System.</p> <p style="tab-stops: -.5in 0in;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="tab-stops: -.5in 0in;"><span style="color: red;">Updated 10/02 to reflect different POCs for&nbsp; Core and Services proposals.</span></p>',0,0,284);
